OL,3,GNEWSALow carbon heating scheme extended
OL,4,Auntil 2030
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn initiative to help people in Jersey
OL,7,Fheat homes in a more
OL,8,Fenvironmentally-friendly way has been
OL,9,Fextended until 2030, officials have
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FJersey's government said property
OL,13,Fowners could apply for up to #9,000
OL,14,Fmatch funding for an air source heat
OL,15,Fpump, or up to #4,000 for other
OL,16,Fapproved technologies under the low
OL,17,Fcarbon heating incentive. Low income
OL,18,Fhouseholds could receive up to #15,000
OL,19,Fwithout match funding, it added.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
