OL,3,GNEWSALow carbon heating scheme extended
OL,4,Auntil 2030
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials said scheme benefits included
OL,7,Flower heating bills, lower carbon
OL,8,Femissions and future-proofing
OL,9,Fproperties.
OL,11,FEnvironment Minister Mary Le Hegarat
OL,12,Fsaid it provided "certainty for
OL,13,Fhomeowners and businesses, with
OL,14,Finvestment being put into more
OL,15,Fefficient heating systems".
